					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_a15@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "The SVD Dragunov sniper rifle is a semi-automatic sniper that can deal 10-9 damage on every registered shot. Remember to crouch before shooting this gun, otherwise your bullets will go all over the place."
