					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_6363734@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "A grenade that is often used to blow up a certain area or blowing up players that are close to each other. Very useful if you have low health and you think there is an enemy on the other side. Just pull the pin, and throw it!"
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_4@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			},
			{
				"header_c7@how_to_play_common.header": {
					"$text": "Smoke Granade"
				}
			},
			{
				"image_a3@how_to_play_common.image": {
					"texture": "textures/granades/smoke",
					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_c5@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "A smoke grenade is a canister-type grenade used as a signaling device, target or landing zone marking device, or as a screening device for unit movements. Upon this grenade's explosion, it will make a screening emitter that makes people unable to see through it."
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_c5@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			},
			{
				"header_dkksjc7@how_to_play_common.header": {
					"$text": "Flashbang Granade"
				}
			},
			{
				"image_wuwyga3@how_to_play_common.image": {
					"texture": "textures/granades/flashbang",
					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_c5sjuwy@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "A stun grenade, also known as a flash grenade, flashbang, thunderflash or sound bomb, is an ostensibly non-lethal explosive device, used to temporarily disorient an enemy's senses. Upon releasing this grenade, it will blind all players in the radius of 10 blocks for 10 seconds."
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_chshs5@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			},
			{
				"header_dkkss7@how_to_play_common.header": {
					"$text": "Molotov"
				}
			},
			{
				"image_wfgds@how_to_play_common.image": {
					"texture": "textures/granades/molotov",
					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_csyrdv@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "A flame grenade that was named after Vyacheslav Molotov. This grenade was manufactured differently in this add-on, instead, the player needs to wait for the grenade to explode so it bursts out its fire for 350 ticks."
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_bruh5@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			},
			{
				"header_ds64f3@how_to_play_common.header": {
					"$text": "Poisonous Gas"
				}
			},
			{
				"image_wfgdsds@how_to_play_common.image": {
					"texture": "textures/granades/pois",
					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_czy7r8dcv@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "A deadly weapon from WWI, the Poisonous Gas has a radius of 4 blocks. In that radius all players (and you) will be affected with Fatal Poison that can kill in a matter of seconds. You better run away when this thing is summoned!"
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_bruh69@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			},
			{
				"header_ds64f3@how_to_play_common.header": {
					"$text": "M67 Grenade"
				}
			},
			{
				"image_wfgdsds@how_to_play_common.image": {
					"texture": "textures/granades/m67",
					"size": [
						"100%",
						"100px"
					]
				}
			},
			{
				"paragraph_czy7r8dcv@how_to_play_common.paragraph": {
					"$text": "Do you miss when you used splash potions as grenades? do you miss the fact when a splash potion hits anything then it explodes on impact? if so, The M67 Frag Grenade is for you!"
				}
			},
			{
				"padding_bruh69@how_to_play_common.padding": {}
			}
		]
	},
